WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.460
- All right, let's close out
with something super fun,

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.890
and pulled right from the
virtual pages of Instagram.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:05.958
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:09.360
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.210
So as you may know, I'm a
proud baby of the 80s, y'all.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.043
That's right.

00:00:13.043 --> 00:00:15.840
It's the era of such
distinct and amazing styles,

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.410
such as leg warmers, off the
shoulder, oversized sweatshirts

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.950
and velcro high tops, if
you were super classy.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.590
Well, one Connecticut man has encapsulated

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:29.130
some other huge trends
of the 80s in his home.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.640
So he redid his newly
purchased 1890 farmhouse.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.910
top to bottom with all
the pastels, flamingos,

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.280
and palm trees that your heart can desire.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.790
He says it's Barbie's dream
house meets Miami 80s motel

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.300
meets Golden Girls, and
it's simply amazing.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.730
We have this visionary
designer on the line right now,

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.890
watching on NBC 4, New York at three.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:51.199
What's up Johnny?

00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:53.520
(audience cheering)

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.810
- Hi Kelly! How are you?

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:57.300
- Hello! Oh my God, I love your house.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.740
So in the past two years

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.630
you've completely
transformed this home, right?

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.220
So take us through the highlights.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.930
- Yeah, so my partner and I,

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:08.070
we bought our home in the
early stages of the pandemic,

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.930
and girl, it needed a glow up.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.300
I mean, it was spooky okie.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.820
I'm talking, the walls were beige,

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:16.320
the floors were beige.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.110
And so, day one of owning the house,

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:23.163
I busted out the pink
paint, and went to town.

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:26.820
We then started to go to estate sales,

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.640
and found really cool vintage 80s pieces

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.700
and sort of, designed each
room around the pieces

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.260
that we are sourcing.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.510
For instance, the living room was designed

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.910
around the pink couch,

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:42.750
the kitchen was designed
around the big, blue fridge,

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.810
and the master bedroom was designed

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:49.140
around no other than Miss Piggy herself

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.790
with her glamour shot.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.370
She's the first thing I see
when I wake up in the morning

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:56.670
and she says, "Honey, we are
going to have a good day."

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:57.819
- I love that.

00:01:57.819 --> 00:01:59.461
(audience cheering)

00:01:59.461 --> 00:02:00.900
Thank you so much, Johnny.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.100
We love your house.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.012
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:02:04.012 --> 00:02:07.647
(audience cheering)

00:02:07.647 --> 00:02:09.090
All right, and that's not all my, man.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.110
Our season long partner,

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.510
Pilot Pen, makers of FriXion
the go to erasable pen,

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.560
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:15.840
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly,

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.150
and amazingly so, just like you.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.770
So they're giving you a thousand dollars

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:20.619
just for being you, man.

00:02:20.619 --> 00:02:23.100
(audience cheering)

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.123
- Are you kidding?

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.000
- Well, thank you Johnny,

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.328
and thank you to all our guests today.

00:02:28.328 --> 00:02:29.161
(audience cheering)

00:02:29.161 --> 00:02:31.860
Kit Hoover, Frida Gustavsson, Kelly Rizzo,

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.600
Isaiah, Jude and Ronnie.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.433
Y'all have a great day,

00:02:34.433 --> 00:02:36.147
and if it's not, try and change it.

